#. module: concert_halls
#: model_terms:event.event,description:concert_halls.event_event_4
msgid ""
"With a setlist packed with anthems like <em>Paint It Black</em>, <em>Start "
"Me Up</em>, <em>Gimme Shelter</em>, and <em>Sympathy for the Devil</em>, "
"Mick, Keith, Ronnie, and the band will bring that signature Stones swagger, "
"raw power, and ageless energy that only they can deliver. No gimmicks. No "
"filler. Just timeless riffs, pounding drums, and the kind of stage presence "
"that makes history every single night."
msgstr ""
"Dengan daftar lagu yang berisi lagu-lagu ikonik, seperti <em>Paint It Black</"
"em>, <em>Start Me Up</em>, <em>Gimme Shelter</em>, dan <em>Sympathy for the "
"Devil</em>, Mick, Keith, Ronnie, dan band-nya akan menghadirkan gaya khas "
"The Stones yang penuh percaya diri, kekuatan yang meletup-letup, dan energi "
"yang tak pernah padam pada penampilan mereka. Tanpa gimmick aneh. Tanpa lagu "
"pengisi. Hanya riff keren, drum yang menggelegar, dan kehadiran panggung "
"yang menciptakan sejarah setiap malam."

